# TH-014: Salt dissolution can warm one solution and cool another
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g
measure v1 thermometer
add v1 CaCl2 0.01mol
measure v1 thermometer
new
add v2 water 100g
measure v2 thermometer
add v2 KCl 0.01mol
measure v2 thermometer
inspect
